verlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z8p11dxeHbbYHnvsrfXdHHBdR8l.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2017-02-27\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Pilot\",\"overview\":\"The murder of Bryan Mills' sister launches him into a dangerous mission for revenge against cartel boss Carlos Mejia. A secret US intelligence agency, led by Christina Hart, covertly uses Bryan as bait to capture Mejia, and in the end recruits Bryan to become a part of their team.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAfVgoGdyv2OFFPtuPMkCysi2nl.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Ready\",\"overview\":\"Bryan gets his first chance in the field but the mission goes bust, resulting in a tragic death. The team uncovers a group of government officials skimming off of refugee funds, which also leads Christina to reconnect with a long lost love. Meanwhile, Asha shows up unexpectedly at Bryan's doorstep.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ecc3q43eH6pxQJCgBzUGx42FiVa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Off Side\",\"overview\":\"Bryan and team search for a suspected terrorist who has been taken, leading them to uncover a deeper plot within their own government. Christina receives troubling news and turns to Harry for support. Asha expresses her concern over Bryan's fixation with Mejia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xALSpGP7AARsu7LrgiorCGMwSqH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":8,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-13\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Mattie G.\",\"overview\":\"Riley's insistence to uncover the truth behind a fatal drug given to war vets results in her asset's child being taken. Bryan defies orders to rescue the girl and uncover the truth. When a break-in at Asha's apartment leaves her shaken, a new neighbor is there to calm her nerves.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aun7O8d3O3vXPtjO8hzoJbakrKJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-20\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"A Clockwork Swiss\",\"overview\":\"Christina orders the retrieval of sensitive documents in Zurich needed to prevent economic and political disaster. But the mission to break into a bank vault turns into a three-way battle, and a race to escape safely. Meanwhile, Asha's trust in Elena proves to be misplaced and leaves Bryan vulnerable.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sR3lWzORZUuBZTFrPxwBtIx9k9H.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":7,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Hail Mary\",\"overview\":\"The ODNI is asked to facilitate the defection of a Russian FSB agent, but the agent's pregnant girlfriend throws a curve in the team's plans. Meanwhile, Christina goes off the books to reveal a mole in the CIA, and John's attempt to resolve his brother's problem with a local gang results in a spiritual crisis.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zY1GndoEQgoYDZO6hMCBZYBUjSe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":7,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-03\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Solo\",\"overview\":\"During the team's efforts to thwart a Mejia weapons operation, Bryan is taken. As he relies on his ODNI training to survive, the team attempts a daring rescue. Meanwhile, Bryan and Asha take their relationship to the next level.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8BAkRCUFb8zrIMh69yumFihnY4x.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":8,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Leah\",\"overview\":\"A Mossad agent from Christina's past asks for her help and protection. First, they need to know who is trying to kill Leah, then the \\\"why\\\" becomes rather obvious.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lensEhP0ArMVdZF4INEhjkWJExJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":7,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-17\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Gone\",\"overview\":\"The spouse of an FBI agent is kidnapped.  Bryan wants nothing left to chance when Mexico demands the return of Mejia. Asha learns the identify of her friendly neighbor.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oOWpXLWXcilnIT68mLPmd6cOfFv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":8,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"I Surrender\",\"overview\":\"In the season finale, the FBI threatens to remove Christina from command and Bryan and John lead a rogue mission that risks everything to stop Mejia's associates before.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6cRc0pIhqJOcgun1yvhPFR4Jlrl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":8,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-01\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2017-02-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}